Add /fast to the composer for Claude and Codex sessions, and show when fast
mode is on.

/fast is listed in the slash menu of claude-native and codex-native sessions
and is sent to the runner as plaintext. A bare /fast becomes /fast on or
/fast off from the state the composer shows, so it can't open the CLI's
picker; any other argument is refused with a usage hint. The fast_mode of
session.usage events and the omnigent.fast_mode session label drive a small,
filled lightning bolt left of the model selector, with a tooltip. Pairs with
the runner patch 0004-fast-mode.patch and the server patch
0008-fast-mode.patch. Applies after 0002-composer-tailscale-host.patch. Base:
omnigent v0.15.0 (c8b9b85f822f).

